[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_MIL]
Every Place Without Light

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_MIL_desc]
In the dark, our power is endless. Be prepared to face the shadow demons that can swallow your soul at any time. Remember, the greatest threat to you is your own despair.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_MIL]
一切无光之所

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_MIL_desc]
在黑暗中，我们的力量无穷无尽。准备好面对随时吞没你灵魂的影魔吧，切记，对你最大的威胁，是你自己的绝望。

